cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as follows."
title: "PyDRAMsim3 — event-driven Python host for DRAMsim3"
abstract: >-
  Discrete-event Python bindings for DRAMsim3.  The host API is
  submit / wait / drain; DRAMsim3 remains cycle-accurate in C++.
  Includes a SimEngine hot loop, bulk completion export, and zero-copy
  numpy trace driving.  For CPU, GPU, and accelerator architecture
  simulation.
authors:
